@startuml
title M-Pesa STK Push Flow
actor Customer
participant "Nuxt Frontend" as Frontend
participant "SokoHub API" as Api
participant "Payments" as Payments
database "Redis" as Cache
participant "Daraja" as Daraja
participant "RabbitMQ" as Broker
participant "Workers" as Workers

Customer -> Frontend: enter phone and amount
Frontend -> Api: POST /api/payments/initiate
Api -> Payments: InitiatePayment
Payments -> Cache: store mpesa:checkout:{id}\nTTL 10 minutes
Payments -> Daraja: Lipana na M-Pesa Online
Daraja --> Payments: CheckoutRequestID and MerchantRequestID
Payments --> Api: payment intent
Api --> Frontend: STK prompt accepted
Customer -> Daraja: approve PIN
Daraja -> Api: POST /api/payments/mpesa/callback
Api --> Daraja: HTTP 200
Api -> Payments: HandleMpesaCallback
Payments -> Cache: check receipt idempotency
Payments -> Cache: load payment by CheckoutRequestID
Payments -> Payments: apply callback
alt result code 0
  Payments -> Payments: mark succeeded
  Payments -> Broker: OrderConfirmed and PaymentSucceeded
  Broker -> Workers: consume events
else result code nonzero
  Payments -> Payments: mark failed
  Payments -> Broker: PaymentFailed
  Broker -> Workers: consume failure
end
@enduml
